    <string name="howto_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="howto_share">• Share: in WeChat or any app, tap Share and pick “WeChatBridge”.</string>
    <string name="howto_open_with">• Files: open a ZIP, TXT, image or video in WeChat, choose “Open with another app”, then “WeChatBridge”.</string>
    <string name="howto_paste">• Text: copy several messages and use “Paste from clipboard” above.</string>
    <string name="howto_collect">• More than one batch: share each batch to “Collect into WeChatBridge”, then tap “Finish and send”.</string>
    <string name="howto_privacy">WeChatBridge never reads WeChat\'s database, uses no accessibility service and has no network access. Everything stays in this app until you send it.</string>

